  "description": "IoT Generic Serial Driver — standards-compliant serial port driver implementing IDriver/DriverBase. Supports multi-device sharing of a single COM port via INode. Built-in SerialTransport (ITransport) for Open/Close/Send/Receive/SendReceive operations.  |  IoT通用串口驱动，符合IoT标准的串口驱动实现，通过INode支持多设备共用同一COM口，内置SerialTransport传输层。",
